# Langa Konnect — Community directory for Langa

Langa Konnect is a lightweight, client-side single-page app (SPA) that connects the Langa community to local businesses, organisations, and events.

## Features

- User registration and login (stored in browser for demo)
- Browse businesses by category and search by name or location
- Business owners can add their businesses (must be logged in)
 - Business owners can add, edit, delete their businesses and upload a photo (stored as data URL in browser)
- Organisations (including Just Grace NPC) with info and reviews
- Users can rate and review businesses and organisations
- Create and list local events
- Data is stored in `localStorage` (no backend)

## How to run

1. Open `index.html` in your browser (double-click or right-click > Open with... > your browser).
2. Register an account (Login/Register button) to add businesses or events and leave reviews.

Notes:
- This is a demo: data is saved locally in your browser using `localStorage` and is not shared.
- To reset data, clear the site's storage in your browser's developer tools or run `localStorage.clear()` from the console.

## Files

- `index.html` — Main SPA markup and structure
- `app.js` — Client-side logic (authentication, data, UI)
- `style.css` — Small custom styles

## Development

You can extend this project by adding a backend API to persist data, adding authentication, or improving UI/UX.

### Recommended backend
- Supabase (Postgres, Auth, Storage, Edge Functions) — fast to launch and scales well. See `backend/README.md` and `backend/sql/schema.sql` for setup and schema examples.

---
This repository was converted from a simple clothing demo into the Langa Konnect community app.